{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/87185cd6746afa810242c38a4404d9c3.avif?t=1761593663\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras_big/87185cd6746afa810242c38a4404d9c3.avif?t=1761593663 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>In the heart of an ancient Japanese castle, the past never dies, it only whispers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep within the misty mountains stands <strong>Kurogane Castle</strong>, a fortress untouched by time, sealed by rituals long forgotten. Legends say those who enter hear the voices of the dead, chanting, waiting, remembering. You arrive not as a warrior, but as a seeker of truth only to find that the truth is what the castle itself decides to reveal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the haunted corridors of <strong>a living structure</strong>, where walls shift and shadows breathe. Each puzzle you solve opens a new wound in time revealing the castle\u2019s cursed history, its rituals of blood, and the souls that still remain bound within its halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the louder the whispers become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/e551f49779e22b9619fd7ec7b5b90d9a.poster.avif?t=1761593663\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/e551f49779e22b9619fd7ec7b5b90d9a.webm?t=1761593663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/e551f49779e22b9619fd7ec7b5b90d9a.mp4?t=1761593663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0fGAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You walk where no one dares.<br>The castle breathes - walls shift, candles die, and the air hums with ritual chants long forgotten.<br>Each puzzle you solve stains you deeper into its memory.<br>Each door unlocked pulls you closer to a truth older than death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing inside sleeps. Not even you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/a1ef21bb2fcb0531be6fde5837e101f1.avif?t=1761593663\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras_big/a1ef21bb2fcb0531be6fde5837e101f1.avif?t=1761593663 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0fTHE CASTLE OFFERS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms that remember your steps - and your fears.<br>Ritual puzzles carved in blood and time.<br>Whispers that guide and deceive.<br>Relics of gods who demanded too much.<br>A curse that binds your reflection to theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/6aa52d63ae121ee50e42bae3e894cc30.avif?t=1761593663\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras_big/6aa52d63ae121ee50e42bae3e894cc30.avif?t=1761593663 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf83 WISHLIST NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The season of shadows has arrived, when old rituals are remembered and forgotten voices stir again. <br>While others chase fleeting frights, <strong>Kurogane Castle waits in silence</strong>, its secrets sealed behind doors no one dares open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong><i>Whispers of Kurogane Castle</i></strong> to your wishlist and be ready to enter its cursed halls when the whispers return.<br>Because <strong>the ritual doesn\u2019t end with Halloween - it begins there.</strong>   <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326950?t=1761593663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326950?t=1761593663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/7d8660119f7c7a4275dfbc515ac3840951d8a22a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761593663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/7d8660119f7c7a4275dfbc515ac3840951d8a22a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761593663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/87185cd6746afa810242c38a4404d9c3.avif?t=1761593663\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras_big/87185cd6746afa810242c38a4404d9c3.avif?t=1761593663 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>In the heart of an ancient Japanese castle, the past never dies, it only whispers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep within the misty mountains stands <strong>Kurogane Castle</strong>, a fortress untouched by time, sealed by rituals long forgotten. Legends say those who enter hear the voices of the dead, chanting, waiting, remembering. You arrive not as a warrior, but